	(text "MIDI: bridge SPARE1-MIDI_TX and SPARE2-MIDI_RX (adjacent holes)\nwith a wire or shunt. Left open, SPARE1/2 are plain GPIO.\nOn a Pico, move the SDK console off UART0 to USB.\nRUN: wire a reset button to GND (Pico or ESP32-P4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85.09 162.56 0)
